<div xmlns:jsp="http://java.sun.com/JSP/Page">
	<jsp:directive.page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" />
	<jsp:output omit-xml-declaration="yes" />
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt">
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span lang="ZH-CN" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: SimSun">二、</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: 華康細圓體" lang="ZH-CN">學費</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, sans-serif"> Tuition Fee: </span></b>
		<span lang="ZH-CN"
			style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: SimSun">全修生每學期</span>
		<span style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Optane">$2,000.00, </span>
		<span lang="ZH-CN"
			style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: SimSun">選修生每學分</span>
		<span style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Optane">$200.00</span>
		<span lang="ZH-TW"
			style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: MingLiU">。</span>
		<span style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Full time student each quarter $2,000.00; part time student $200.00 per credit. </span>
		
	</p>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt">
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span lang="ZH-CN" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: SimSun">三、</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: 華康細圓體" lang="ZH-CN">註冊時間</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, sans-serif"> Registration Time: </span></b>
		<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">08/03/26 (Mon.) – 08/31/26 (Mon.)</span>
		<span style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">敬請準時。 
		Please register on time.</span>
		<b style="font-size: 13px">
			<u>
				<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 華康細圓體" lang="ZH-TW">罰金</span>
				<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">
					Late Fee: $50.00</span>
			</u>
		</b>
	</p>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt">
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span lang="ZH-CN" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: SimSun">四、</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: 華康細圓體" lang="ZH-CN">註冊說明</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, sans-serif"> Registration Instructions: </span></b>
			<span style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">
			1. “教會行政”、“如何帶領查經” 和所有的音樂課只對在校學生
			"Church Administration", "How to Lead a Bible Study" and all the music courses are open only to on-campus students；
			2. 聲樂課 Voice Lessons： 一對一的聲樂課（一學分）是選修課程， 請向任課教師報名， 並自行與任課教師安排上課時間。  
			Individual Voice Lesson (one credit) is an optional course, please register with the instructor. 
			You have to make an appointment for voice lesson with the instructor individually.  </span>
	</p>
	<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt">
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span lang="ZH-CN" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: SimSun">五、</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: 華康細圓體" lang="ZH-CN">備註</span></b>
		<b style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 13px">
			<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, sans-serif"> Memo: </span></b>
		<span style="line-height: 12pt; font-size: 10pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">
		1.若您要保留選課資料，請自行影印備份存檔。It is the student’s responsibility to keep his/her own record of the courses taken. 
		2.關於旁聽: (1) 神學院同工最多可旁聽兩門神學課: 一門免費；另一門須付50%的學費。Seminary co-workers may audit up to two theology courses: The first one is free; second one at 50% off.  （
		2）所有旁聽者必須登記註冊或經院長特許，任何人不得擅自進入課室。All those taking class for audit have to register or receive Verbal Permission from Dr. Rev. Yang. </span>
	</p>
</div>